{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "197a105c-925f-86f5-bc74-e6daaa2e923e",
  "created_at": "2025-12-03T11:32:29-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "George Lawton",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T11:28:58-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T11:29:03-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, good morning. George Lawton here. My trash didn't get picked up today. Wednesday's my day, and the barrel's still sitting at the curb."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T11:29:13-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'm sorry about that, Mr. Lawton. Can I get the address where the pickup was missed?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T11:29:20-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 90 Van Zandt Avenue. North End."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T11:29:24-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "90 Van Zandt Avenue. And Wednesday is your regular day, you said?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T11:29:29-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Wednesday, every week. Been that way for years. I put it out last night after supper, like always."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T11:29:36-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. Did you see the truck come through at all this morning, or any of your neighbors' barrels getting emptied?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T11:29:44-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, the fella next door had his emptied, I could see that. Mine's full. Lid's down, nothing's blocking it. Nothing parked near it either."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T11:29:54-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so the barrel was out, lid closed, clear of cars. That sounds like it was just missed. I can put in a request for a return pickup."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T11:30:05-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's what I was calling about. And while I got you, how do I ask for a replacement barrel? The one I got is cracked along the bottom. It's been that way a while, but I figure that's why they might have skipped it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T11:30:22-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It could be. A cracked barrel can be flagged by the crew. I can put a replacement request in with the same ticket. Is it the trash barrel or the recycling one that's cracked?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T11:30:35-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The trash. Green one. The recycling's fine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T11:30:39-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, the trash barrel, cracked at the bottom. I'll note that. They'll tell you how the swap works when they get back to you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T11:30:49-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fine. Now, the crew, are they coming from the north end of the street or the south? I only ask because I once drove that whole route the wrong way. Opposite direction, by mistake, coming home from Middletown. Took me a half hour to figure out why nothing looked right. Anyway, that's neither here nor there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T11:31:10-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, I couldn't tell you which direction they run today. The route can change. I'll just note that the barrel is at the curb and the pickup was missed."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T11:31:21-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine. I just wondered."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T11:31:24-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me read this back. George Lawton, 90 Van Zandt Avenue, Wednesday pickup missed, barrel at the curb with the lid closed, and a replacement trash barrel requested because of a crack. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T11:31:38-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T11:31:40-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And can I confirm a callback number in case the crew needs to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T11:31:46-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. 401-555-0196."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T11:31:48-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0196. Got it. Should I leave the barrel out, or do you want to bring it in?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T11:31:55-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Leave it out, I figure. If they come back this afternoon I don't want to miss them. I'll bring it in tonight if they haven't."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T11:32:05-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That sounds reasonable. If they haven't come by tomorrow morning, call us back and mention today's request so we can follow up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T11:32:14-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. Will do."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T11:32:16-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Anything else I can help with today, Mr. Lawton?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T11:32:20-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's everything. Thank you, Lorraine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T11:32:23-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Have a good rest of your day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-03T11:32:27-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Bye now."
    }
  ],
